OL,3,GNEWSACalls for cap on Airbnb-style lets
OL,4,Ain Peterborough                        
OL,6,FThere are calls for greater regulations
OL,7,Fon Airbnb-style property lets in a city
OL,8,Fwhere housing is in short supply.      
OL,10,FAlexander Rafiq, a Peterborough city   
OL,11,Fcouncillor, is calling for a 90-day    
OL,12,Fannual limit on family homes being used
OL,13,Fas short-term accommodation in the city
OL,14,Fwithout planning permission.           
OL,16,FHe said residents had raised concerns  
OL,17,Fabout late-night noise, parking        
OL,18,Fpressures and a constant turnover of   
OL,19,Foccupants.                             
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
