OL,3,GNEWSACalls for cap on Airbnb-style lets
OL,4,Ain Peterborough                        
OL,6,F"There is a significant difference     
OL,7,Fbetween occasionally sharing your home 
OL,8,Fand purchasing or converting an        
OL,9,Fordinary residential house into        
OL,10,Feffectively year-round transient       
OL,11,Faccommodation," said Rafiq.            
